<title>USA: Kinark forms No. American Galvanizing Co.</title>
<headline>Kinark forms No. American Galvanizing Co.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kinark Corp said Thursday it formed a new subsidiary, North American Galvanizing Co, which combines the galvanizing operations of Boyles Galvanizing Co and Rogers Galvanizing Co.</p>
<p>With this combined network, North American Galvanizing Co has the capacity to galvanize more than 200,000 tons of steel annually.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
